name uwa-pif
category Package
revision 64314
shortdesc A Participant Information Form (PIF) for a human research protocol at the University of Western Australia
longdesc This package generates a Participant Information Form (PIF) for
longdesc a human research protocol at the University of Western
longdesc Australia. It requires the UWA logo in PDF format, which is
longdesc available in SVG format at
longdesc https://static-listing.weboffice.uwa.edu.au/visualid/core-rebra
longdesc nd/img/uwacrest/, and uses the Calibri fonts by default. The
longdesc class works with XeLaTeX and LuaLaTeX. It depends on the
longdesc uwa-letterhead package.
